  "description": "Build a lasting reading habit with Bookmory, the ultimate reading tracker.\n\nSet your yearly reading goals, track your daily reading progress, and keep a beautiful reading journal.\nWith a powerful reading timer, calendar view, and detailed reading stats, staying motivated has never been easier.\n\nWhen you record a book in Bookmory, you don't just track it ΓÇö\nyou remember it forever.\n\n---\n\nPerfect for Readers Who Want To:\nΓÇó Track books they read\nΓÇó Build a consistent reading habit\nΓÇó Keep a reading journal & reading notes\nΓÇó Set reading goals and achieve them\nΓÇó View beautiful reading statistics\nΓÇó Organize their personal book library\n\n---\n\nKey Features\n\nEasy Book Tracking\nΓÇó Add books via search or barcode scan\nΓÇó Organize books with collections & series\nΓÇó Manage your library with custom tags\nΓÇó Rate and review finished books\n\nReading Timer & Progress Tracker\nΓÇó Log pages read\nΓÇó Track reading time with a built-in reading timer\nΓÇó Set daily reading goals\nΓÇó Set yearly reading goals\nΓÇó Stay motivated with a reading streak feature\n\nReading Journal & Notes\nΓÇó Write beautiful reading notes with a powerful editor\nΓÇó Highlight your favorite quotes\nΓÇó Extract text from photos using OCR\nΓÇó Share notes with aesthetic backgrounds\nΓÇó Random note feature to revisit past insights\n\nReading Stats & Calendar\nΓÇó Yearly reading statistics\nΓÇó Track pages and reading time trends\nΓÇó Reading calendar to visualize your progress\nΓÇó Annual Rewind feature (available every December)\n\nCustomization & Security\nΓÇó Multiple themes to match your style\nΓÇó App lock with password protection\nΓÇó iCloud backup support\n\n---\n\nPremium Features\nΓÇó Remove all ads\nΓÇó Automatic sync across multiple devices\nΓÇó No manual backup required\nΓÇó Additional exclusive themes\n\n---\n\nYour All-in-One Reading Tracker\n\nBookmory is more than a book tracker.\nIt's a reading log, reading journal, reading timer, and reading goal app ΓÇö all in one place.\n\nTrack your books.\nMeasure your reading time.\nBuild a lasting reading habit.\n\nStart your reading journey with Bookmory today.\n\nContact: tonysoft.net@gmail.com",
